    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "You must obtain exclusive access to the device by calling [`lockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/lockforconfiguration().md) before setting this property value.",
      "ko": "You must obtain exclusive access to the device by calling [`lockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/lockforconfiguration().md) before setting this property value.",
      "sourceHash": "c5a0be168e4fcec3e096485feb9a6e8288f9653b5a053ec115d26c3a72d0fb1a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "You can set this property only to formats present in the active format’s [`supportedDepthDataFormats`](avcapturedevice/format/supporteddepthdataformats.md) array.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 활성 형식의 [`supportedDepthDataFormats`](avcapturedevice/format/supporteddepthdataformats.md) 배열에 있는 형식으로만 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2b6d4e723eefea3d1c29996b1e2efbdcd020468699481884922d53eae7af81d9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "Attempting to set an unsupported format throws an exception.",
      "ko": "지원되지 않는 형식을 설정하려고 하면 예외가 발생합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6ba8c2142199024323f2d04f17a13e2ebc73333f4f9309ccd18525381601e459",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "You can’t set the frame rate of depth data directly.",
      "ko": "깊이 데이터의 프레임 속도를 직접 설정할 수 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fa200d99bed2add6a4388cb4e835ab15610021ff9a7f4dc612514579ef41094b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0002",
      "source": "Instead, the system synchronizes the depth data frame rate to the device’s [`activeVideoMinFrameDuration`](avcapturedevice/activevideominframeduration.md) and [`activeVideoMaxFrameDuration`](avcapturedevice/activevideomaxframeduration.md) values.",
      "ko": "대신 시스템은 깊이 데이터 프레임 속도를 장치의 [`activeVideoMinFrameDuration`](avcapturedevice/activevideominframeduration.md) 및 [`activeVideoMaxFrameDuration`](avcapturedevice/activevideomaxframeduration.md) 값에 맞춰 동기화합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b63733f3cc55b0dc80dfb32e7500b1ce2137cd5e6d320f955cc9bbc8bf5c689f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0003",
      "source": "It may match the device’s current frame rate, or lower, if the system can’t produce depth data fast enough for the active video frame rate.",
      "ko": "시스템이 활성 비디오 프레임 속도에 맞춰 깊이 데이터를 충분히 빠르게 생성하지 못하면, 장치의 현재 프레임 속도와 같거나 더 낮을 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "422c3ce49f4214d408cc25d50944c94de685e2fc0357a4dae737cd35e52a75ad",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0013:0001",
      "source": "Delivery of depth data to a [`AVCaptureDepthDataOutput`](avcapturedepthdataoutput.md) may increase the system load, resulting in a reduced video frame rate for thermal sustainability.",
      "ko": "[`AVCaptureDepthDataOutput`](avcapturedepthdataoutput.md)로 깊이 데이터를 전달하면 시스템 부하가 증가해 열 안정성 유지를 위해 비디오 프레임 속도가 낮아질 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2a5e722a2628ef6457955a290df0236f507d812d60fd6e33ddcbe40e9de2205b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0014:0001",
      "source": "On devices where depth data isn’t supported, this property value is `nil`.",
      "ko": "깊이 데이터가 지원되지 않는 장치에서는 이 속성 값이 `nil`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "45e5cad7a4989042849ced5bc2c21551fc4da5781144e8533cd1ed414ed8f44e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0015:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 키-값 관측 가능합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "da10f6fb15a1291aedea3de21f0a99a0321c2e86790d0f3fd44477cca7d3c9a7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
